{
 "Hello! Welcome. I'm here to help you with questions about learning, accessibility, and more. What would you like to know today?": "audio/en_4ce0f4261a.mp3",
 "ሰላም! እንኳን ደህና መጡ። ስለ ትምህርት፣ ተደራሽነት እና ሌሎች ጥያቄዎች ልረዳዎት እችላለሁ። ዛሬ ምን ማወቅ ይፈልጋሉ?": "audio/am_8bcf56b199.mp3",
 "Good morning! I hope you have a peaceful and productive day ahead.": "audio/en_8377895d36.mp3",
 "እንደምን አደሩ! መልካም እና ሰላማዊ ቀን ይሁንልዎ።": "audio/am_933e0bc3ad.mp3",
 "Good afternoon! How is your day going so far?": "audio/en_326167d8d7.mp3",
 "እንደምን ዋሉ! ቀንዎ እንዴት እየሄደ ነው?": "audio/am_44050d1731.mp3",
 "Good evening! I hope you're having a relaxing time.": "audio/en_327191c44e.mp3",
 "እንደምን አመሹ! መልካም ምሽት።": "audio/am_9419f45087.mp3",
 "You're very welcome! I'm happy to help. Feel free to ask more questions anytime.": "audio/en_70cbc1082b.mp3",
 "በጣም አመሰግናለሁ! ሌላ ጥያቄ ካለዎት በማንኛውም ጊዜ ይጠይቁ።": "audio/am_0e90b1483f.mp3",
 "Goodbye! Take care and have a wonderful day. See you next time.": "audio/en_131ea209fa.mp3",
 "ደህና ሁኑ! መልካም ቀን ይሁንልዎ።": "audio/am_f0497a87f4.mp3",
 "Ethiopia is a country located in East Africa. It has a rich history and culture. The capital city is Addis Ababa.": "audio/en_103160276f.mp3",
 "ኢትዮጵያ በምሥራቅ አፍሪካ ያለች ሀገር ናት። የበለጸገ ታሪክ እና ባህል አላት። ዋና ከተማዋ አዲስ አበባ ናት።": "audio/am_86570aa9d4.mp3",
 "Kenya is a country in East Africa known for its wildlife and national parks. Its capital is Nairobi.": "audio/en_32cda4cf92.mp3",
 "ኬንያ በምሥራቅ አፍሪካ ያለች ሀገር ናት። በዱር እንስሳት እና ብሔራዊ ፓርኮች ትታወቃለች። ዋና ከተማዋ ናይሮቢ ነው።": "audio/am_99ac9fd4a2.mp3",
 "Addis Ababa is the capital and largest city of Ethiopia. It is an important political and cultural center.": "audio/en_0d2f828ddd.mp3",
 "አዲስ አበባ የኢትዮጵያ ዋና ከተማ እና ትልቁ ከተማ ናት። አስፈላጊ የፖለቲካ እና የባህል ማዕከል ናት።": "audio/am_0dd7bcfc1e.mp3",
 "I'm doing well, thank you for asking! How can I help you today?": "audio/en_13fe6699b0.mp3",
 "ደህና ነኝ፣ ስለጠየቁኝ አመሰግናለሁ! ዛሬ በምን ልርዳዎት?": "audio/am_2d5634a36e.mp3",
 "I am the Multilingual Learning Assistant. I answer questions in English and Amharic and can read answers aloud.": "audio/en_da1ff9497f.mp3",
 "እኔ የመማሪያ ረዳት ነኝ። በእንግሊዝኛ እና በአማርኛ ጥያቄዎችን እመልሳለሁ፣ መልሶችንም በድምፅ አነባለሁ።": "audio/am_73831b1af6.mp3",
 "You can ask me almost anything: science, history, countries, people, health, technology and more. You can also ask math like 25 * 4, or the Ethiopian date.": "audio/en_56e3dc4ca1.mp3",
 "ማንኛውንም ጥያቄ መጠየቅ ይችላሉ፦ ሳይንስ፣ ታሪክ፣ ሀገራት፣ ሰዎች፣ ጤና፣ ቴክኖሎጂ እና ሌሎችም። እንደ 25 * 4 ያሉ የሂሳብ ጥያቄዎችን ወይም የኢትዮጵያን ቀን መጠየቅ ይችላሉ።": "audio/am_bf51ed60ea.mp3",
 "Visual support is designed for people who have low vision or are blind. This tool includes Read Aloud so users can listen to answers, High Contrast mode for better visibility, and text size controls. These features help make information more accessible and independent.": "audio/en_b7000b714b.mp3",
 "የዕይታ ድጋፍ ማየት ለሚቸግራቸው ወይም ለዓይነ ስውራን የተሰራ ነው። ይህ መሳሪያ የድምፅ ንባብ፣ ከፍተኛ ንፅፅር እና የጽሑፍ መጠን ማስተካከል ያካትታል።": "audio/am_a9cf57fa19.mp3",
 "Hearing support helps people who are Deaf or hard of hearing. All answers are displayed clearly in written text in both Amharic and English, so users can access information without needing sound.": "audio/en_1faae6fb43.mp3",
 "የመስማት ድጋፍ ለመስማት ለሚቸግራቸው ሰዎች ይረዳል። መልሶች በአማርኛ እና በእንግሊዝኛ በጽሑፍ በግልጽ ይታያሉ።": "audio/am_46570d6aca.mp3",
 "Mobility support is for people with physical disabilities. The buttons are large and easy to press, and voice input is available so users do not always need to type with their hands.": "audio/en_f793db5f69.mp3",
 "የእንቅስቃሴ ድጋፍ አካላዊ እንቅስቃሴ ለሚቸግራቸው ሰዎች የተሰራ ነው። ቁልፎች ትልቅ ናቸው እና የድምፅ ግብዓትም ይገኛል።": "audio/am_906a1afb5b.mp3",
 "This Multilingual Learning Assistant was created for the Accessibility Hackathon 2026. The goal is to build simple and inclusive tools that help people who are blind, Deaf, have physical or cognitive disabilities, and refugees in Ethiopia access information and learning more easily.": "audio/en_2a9179abed.mp3",
